            "text": "theorem weighted_heat_difference_bound {h ν r : ℝ} (hh : 0 < h) (hν : ν ∈ Icc (0 : ℝ) 1)\n    (hr : 0 < r) (C : ℝ) :\n    |r ^ 2 * (heatCarrier h C ν r - referencePower h C r)| ≤\n      (4 * |C| * (2 : ℝ) ^ A h * h * (1 + h)) * r ^ (-1 - 2 * h)"
